\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\ src/keccak.fam — Keccak (FIPS 202): the permutation Keccak-f[1600], and the
\ sponge over it -- SHA3-256, SHA3-512, SHAKE128, SHAKE256 -- what Kyber
\ and Dilithium hash and sample with (src/kyber.fam, src/dilithium.fam).
\
\   kperm ( st -- )             the permutation, on 200 bytes
\   kbeg ( rate pad -- )        start a sponge (rate in bytes; pad 6: SHA3,
\                               1F: SHAKE)
\   kabs ( a n -- )             absorb n bytes
\   kend ( -- )                 pad: from here, squeeze
\   ksqz ( out n -- )           squeeze n bytes (any number of times)
\   sha3256 sha3512 ( a n out -- )   a digest of n bytes, at out
\   shake128 shake256 ( a n out m -- )   m bytes of output
\ One sponge at a time (kst): a caller that needs two keeps one's output.
\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

